OL,3,GNEWSA'Freezing council tax was the
OL,4,Aright thing to do'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former council leader has spoken out
OL,7,Fto defend his administration's decision
OL,8,Fto freeze council tax "during a time of
OL,9,Fausterity".
OL,11,FAn independent report into Shropshire
OL,12,FCouncil's dire financial situation
OL,13,Fclaimed the legacy impact of historic
OL,14,Fcouncil tax freezes was one of the
OL,15,Freasons why the authority was
OL,16,Fstruggling to balance its books.
OL,18,FThe council did not increase its share
OL,19,Fof the bill for six years, from 2010 to
OL,20,F2016, resulting in a cumulative loss of
OL,21,Fincome, thought to be worth about #20m
OL,22,Fby the last financial year.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
