OL,3,GNEWSA'Freezing council tax was the
OL,4,Aright thing to do'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Conservative leader Keith Barrow
OL,7,Fsaid the council had benefitted from
OL,8,Fspecific government grants to freeze
OL,9,Fcouncil tax, which was "at the time,
OL,10,Fthe right thing to do".
